 309:  * @brief 从/tmp/wifi.txt文件中提取WiFi SSID
 310:  * @param ap_names 用于存储SSID的二维字符数组
 311:  * @param max_count ap_names数组的最大行数
 312:  * @return 实际提取到的SSID数量
 313:  * 
 314:  * /tmp/wifi_scan_result.txt文件格式示例:
 315:  * bssid / frequency / signal level / encode / ssid
 316:  * 74:39:89:f8:f0:ae       5240    -59     0803    Programmers7
 317:  * 76:39:89:fe:f0:ae       5240    -62     0803
 318:  * 48:8a:d2:d1:62:a2       2412    -73     8000    MERCURY_62A2
 319:  * f0:92:b4:a6:03:91       2422    -75     0803    ChinaNet-kRAH
